    "title": "0",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "よもや黒猫に財布を奪われた挙句、\nトレーニングの時間と場所も\n違っていたとは……っ！？",
            "enText": "I can't believe this. After my wallet was stolen\nby a black cat, I also messed up the time and\nplace of our training session.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -6121643778772452380,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "うぅ、ごめんなさい。\nライスのせいだよね……。",
            "enText": "Urgh… I'm sorry. This was all my fault.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -2200076359932670083,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "わ、私が勘違いしたせいかと！\nすみませんです、すみませんです！",
            "enText": "I-I'm the one who misheard the time!\nI'm sorry! I'm really, really sorry!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": -8759795622715748192,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "いいえっ！\nおふた方のせいではありません！\nこれは、そう――",
            "enText": "No! Neither of you are to blame!\nThis is the work of…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -8456025462232956973,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "ウマトラダムスが予言した\n恐怖の大殺界が訪れたんです！",
            "enText": "The prophet Umastradamus! This must be\nthe terrible disaster she foretold!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -6450567150902476826,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "え、そうなの？　じゃあ、\nライスの不幸のせいじゃ……。",
            "enText": "Huh? Really? Then… it wasn't my fault?",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 1734420891445652276,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "ほ、本当ですか？　本当に私の\nドジのせいではないのですか……？",
            "enText": "A-Are you sure… I didn't just screw up again?",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 7088136847954378810,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マチカネフクキタル",
            "enName": "Matikanefukukitaru",
            "jpText": "ええ、断じて違いますっ！\n予言のせいです！！",
            "enText": "I am certain! This is all a part of the prophecy!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7585185508338543005,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ライスシャワー",
            "enName": "Rice Shower",
            "jpText": "よ、よかったぁ～……っ！",
            "enText": "Th-Thank goodness!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -7301326770008887023,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "メイショウドトウ",
            "enName": "Meisho Doto",
            "jpText": "ですね、安心しましたぁ……。",
            "enText": "Yes, that's a relief…",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 6339866486567176719,
            "blockIdx": 10
        }
    ],
